<Page title="Privacy – Fettle London" description="Who we are, what we keep, who helps us run things, and your rights. The plain version.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p class="lede">We keep as little as we need to do good work, and we don&rsquo;t sell it on. Here&rsquo;s the plain version.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="muted">Last updated 10 October 2026.</p>

          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>Fettle London is run by Ilia Koniukhovskii, trading as Fettle London. We&rsquo;re responsible for the personal information described here (the &ldquo;controller&rdquo;, in data protection terms). You can reach us at <a href="mailto:fettlelondon@gmail.com">fettlelondon@gmail.com</a> or on <a href="tel:+447361854124">07361 854124</a>.</p>

          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>When you get in touch:</strong> your name, email, postcode, the topic and your message.</li>
            <li><strong>When you use the chat:</strong> what you type, and your name and phone number if you ask for a call back. Chats are kept so the team can pick up the conversation.</li>
            <li><strong>When you check a postcode:</strong> the area part of your postcode (for example &ldquo;SW10&rdquo;), so we can tell you whether we cover it.</li>
            <li><strong>When we visit:</strong> notes on what needs doing at your home, so we can price and plan the work.</li>
            <li><strong>When you browse:</strong> anonymous visit counts (which pages are viewed, roughly where from). No cookies, and nothing that identifies you.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Why we hold it, and our legal basis</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>To reply to your enquiry, arrange a visit and quote the work &ndash; steps you&rsquo;ve asked us to take before a contract.</li>
            <li>To carry out the work and keep a record of jobs at your home &ndash; performing our contract with you.</li>
            <li>To keep invoices and records for tax and insurance &ndash; a legal obligation.</li>
            <li>To understand which pages of the site help people &ndash; our legitimate interest, using anonymous figures only.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Who helps us run things</h2>
          <p>We use a small number of trusted services to run the website and handle enquiries. They process data only on our instructions:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Vercel</strong> &ndash; hosts this website and provides our cookie-free visitor statistics.</li>
            <li><strong>Supabase</strong> &ndash; stores enquiries sent through the contact form and website chats (servers in Ireland, EU).</li>
            <li><strong>Telegram</strong> &ndash; delivers a notification of each new enquiry, and chats you ask to pass to a person, to our phone so we can reply quickly.</li>
            <li><strong>Anthropic</strong> &ndash; provides the AI that answers questions in the website chat. Your chat messages are sent to it to generate a reply; they are not used to train its models.</li>
            <li><strong>Postcodes.io</strong> &ndash; checks that a postcode you enter is real. Only the postcode is sent.</li>
            <li><strong>Google (Gmail) and WhatsApp</strong> &ndash; if you email or message us, those conversations are held by those services.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Some of these providers may process data outside the UK. Where they do, they rely on safeguards recognised under UK data protection law. Only when a job needs an outside specialist do we share the details they need for that job. We never sell your details or pass them to marketplaces or advertisers.</p>

          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>Enquiries and chats that don&rsquo;t lead to work are deleted within 12 months. If we do work for you, we keep your details for as long as you&rsquo;re on our list, plus six years for tax and insurance records. Ask us to delete what isn&rsquo;t needed and we will.</p>

          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>You can ask to see what we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, object to how we use it, or ask us to stop using it. Write to <a href="mailto:fettlelondon@gmail.com">fettlelondon@gmail.com</a> and a person &ndash; not a bot &ndash; will reply within one month.</p>
          <p>If you&rsquo;re unhappy with how we&rsquo;ve handled your information, you can complain to the Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO) at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">ico.org.uk</a> or on 0303 123 1113. We&rsquo;d appreciate the chance to put it right first.</p>

          <hr class="divider" />
          <p class="muted">Questions about any of this? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
